worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_network_snapshot.js"
  ceiling 107
  rationale "Browser twin of the snapshot branch of the native network_query precedence row (try_network_query in rust/src/retrieval_procedures.rs, PR #1188, issue #1175 routing probes p195-p197). It renders the knowledge network the browser has actually loaded (the agent-info header, a concept index and one rule record per seeded rule intent with its seeded response) in the record shape of knowledge_links_notation (rust/src/engine.rs), quoting values as format_lino_value does. The request cues and rule intents are `network_snapshot` records of data/seed/code-task-cues.lino; the answer is the seeded `network_snapshot` response."
